	<!-- Increase the version number by one major version higher than the original library -->
	<version>2.00</version>
	<!-- =================================================
		 Custom version of the NewQRCodeReaderView library
		 =================================================
		
		Modified NewQRCodeReaderView library by gdmeunier.
		Based on the works of Johan Schoeman & David Lazaro.
		
		Changes:
		
		- Added compatibility with Android 2.3 (API level 9)
		  by checking for the necessary SDK level number and
		  setting the QRCodeReaderView's surface type to
		  SURFACE_TYPE_PUSH_BUFFERS if necessary (constant 0x3).
		
		- Added a setPreviewDisplay() method to the Camera manager
		  to optimize this library for older Android versions.
		
		- Removed unnecessary and redundant startPreview() calls
		  in the QRCodeReaderView's surfaceCreated() method,
		  since this should be done in surfaceChanged() instead.
		  
		  The surfaceCreated method now only uses the methods
		  setPreviewCallback() and the new setPreviewDisplay().
		
		- Added more exception handling try-catch blocks to
		  the QRCodeReaderViews's surfaceCreated() and
		  surfaceChanged() methods to prevent crashes
		  if any error occurs while starting the Camera preview.
		
		- Added some setPreviewDisplay() calls additionally to
		  the original setPreviewCallback() calls in the
		  CameraManager class's surfaceCreated() and
		  surfaceChanged() methods, additionally to adding
		  more exception handling with try-catch blocks.
		
		- Updated the ZXing library to 2.3.0 instead of using
		  the older 2.1.0 version (2.3.0 supports API level 9+).
		
		- Heavily trimmed the ZXing library to remove all
		  the non-QR code functionalities and removed all
		  references to their fields, properties and methods.
		
		- Removed all QR code encoding functionalities from
		  this modified ZXing 2.3.0 library since this App
		  doesn't need to create QR codes (Android PIN Unblocker).
		
		- Trimmed the Java JAR manifest file to only contain
		  the bare minimum information necessary to be valid.
		
		- Heavily re-compressed the ZXing 2.3.0 JAR file for
		  even smaller file sizes.
		
		- Increased the library version from 1.01 to 2.00
		
		 ================================================= -->
	<class>
		<name>newqrcodereaderviewwrapper.newqrcodereaderviewWrapper</name>
